      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHISKY BELLA (2) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 6th at Geelong following on from a win (25.85) at Ballarat the start prior. Looks the one to beat on her best form. SON OF WITCHY (7) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (27.99) last time in a Grade 4/5 at Horsham. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Should be about the mark. BIG COOL (4) has been hard to follow lately, running sixth (26.10) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Shepparton. Can hit the frame this time. BUN QUAKE (8) can fill a top-three spot.",
